  title: "The Faraclarian Clan"
  fullText: "Warriors of a Faraclarian clan surround you, their faces painted with ash. Their chieftain steps forward: \"We seek the Forger, the one who walks between fire and iron.\" You have never heard the name. Every spear waits for your answer.\n\nWhat will you do?"
